1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Fourth Episode
The Snow Eagle

15
00:02:15,661 --> 00:02:18,221
It’s your turn, doctor.
Your knight is in danger,

16
00:02:18,261 --> 00:02:20,252
so watch out for the next move!

17
00:02:21,901 --> 00:02:24,813
It's up to you to play, doctor.
Today you're a bit distracted!

18
00:02:25,101 --> 00:02:27,012
Oh, excuse me!
Let me see!

19
00:02:27,061 --> 00:02:29,655
So... Yes, it seems to me
that you've made a good move!

20
00:02:29,701 --> 00:02:33,137
- There! What do you think?
- Not bad! Not bad!

21
00:02:35,301 --> 00:02:37,576
And after this other move, what will you do?

22
00:02:38,741 --> 00:02:40,697
There's something wrong
with the doctor!

23
00:02:40,741 --> 00:02:42,777
He always likes
playing chess so much...

24
00:02:42,821 --> 00:02:44,732
But today he is so distracted!

25
00:02:45,021 --> 00:02:49,378
- Doctor!
- It's my turn, good! So... There!

26
00:02:49,421 --> 00:02:51,889
Doctor, perhaps it’s
better to stop playing!

27
00:02:52,021 --> 00:02:54,740
If there is something
worrying you, please tell me!

28
00:02:55,981 --> 00:02:59,417
Forgive me, it’s really a silly thing,
but I can't stop thinking about it!

29
00:02:59,461 --> 00:03:03,977
It’s snowing a lot! They say it hasn't
snowed this much in a hundred years!

30
00:03:11,021 --> 00:03:14,331
It has already been
snowing for five days straight!

31
00:03:14,381 --> 00:03:16,292
And what is wrong with that?

32
00:03:16,341 --> 00:03:19,174
There is a legend about an eagle, Princess!

33
00:03:19,221 --> 00:03:22,213
- An eagle?
- It is said that the snow eagle

34
00:03:22,261 --> 00:03:25,173
...it brings a bad omen,
if it appears after a snowfall!

35
00:03:25,221 --> 00:03:27,416
The snow eagle
that brings a bad omen?

36
00:03:27,501 --> 00:03:30,254
Exactly!
It arrives after a heavy snowfall!

37
00:03:30,301 --> 00:03:32,769
And when it covers the country
with its great wings,

38
00:03:32,821 --> 00:03:35,619
it is a harbinger
of some great misfortune!

39
00:03:37,341 --> 00:03:39,457
And you were worried about this?

40
00:03:39,501 --> 00:03:41,617
After all, it is nothing more
than a legend!

41
00:03:41,941 --> 00:03:45,297
Yes! But old legends always
have a foundation of truth!

42
00:03:45,341 --> 00:03:47,252
And this scares me a little!

43
00:03:47,301 --> 00:03:49,531
In the past, every time
a misfortune occurred,

44
00:03:49,581 --> 00:03:52,141
there has always been
a premonitory sign!

45
00:03:53,941 --> 00:03:56,011
What was that noise, doctor?

46
00:03:59,781 --> 00:04:01,851
Princess, the snow eagle...

47
00:04:01,901 --> 00:04:04,813
...that brings the bad omen
has already appeared as I feared!

48
00:04:28,221 --> 00:04:31,850
See? What did I tell you?
Here is the symbol of the bad omen!

49
00:04:31,901 --> 00:04:34,051
Frankly, I was struck
much more...

50
00:04:34,101 --> 00:04:36,410
...by the sound we heard
last night.

51
00:04:37,301 --> 00:04:39,610
Sapphire! Sapphire!

52
00:04:39,701 --> 00:04:43,410
Sapphire, why don't you come down?
So we can make a snowman!

53
00:04:43,461 --> 00:04:46,339
All right, Choppy, I'm coming down!
I'll be down in a minute!

54
00:04:48,661 --> 00:04:50,652
I have already finished, Sapphire!

55
00:04:51,781 --> 00:04:54,375
Tell me, what do you think
of my snowman?

56
00:04:55,261 --> 00:04:57,729
Not bad!
But who is it supposed to be?

57
00:04:58,021 --> 00:05:01,650
It's strange that you don't
recognize the Masked Knight!

58
00:05:01,741 --> 00:05:04,972
- Don't be like that!
- The Masked Knight isn't like that!

59
00:05:05,101 --> 00:05:08,810
He's taller, more elegant, thinner!
And besides, he's more handsome!

60
00:05:11,701 --> 00:05:14,169
Yours! It's Franco!

61
00:05:15,021 --> 00:05:17,740
- Here he comes!
- What?! Franco?!

62
00:05:17,901 --> 00:05:19,892
Hello, guys!

63
00:05:20,621 --> 00:05:22,498
I'm happy to see you.

64
00:05:22,541 --> 00:05:25,374
I didn't come sooner because
of the snowfall. Hi, Choppy!

65
00:05:25,501 --> 00:05:27,492
I am glad you came!

66
00:05:27,661 --> 00:05:29,936
What are you doing?
Can you show it to me?

67
00:05:29,981 --> 00:05:31,892
So I can play with you too!

68
00:05:34,061 --> 00:05:36,814
We were making snowmen.
Look, that one is mine!

69
00:05:37,381 --> 00:05:39,576
- But it's me!
- Do you recognize yourself in that snowman?

70
00:05:39,621 --> 00:05:41,851
Certainly!
You made it look just like me!

71
00:05:42,021 --> 00:05:44,819
Now I will make
a snowman that looks like you

72
00:05:45,581 --> 00:05:47,936
I think I'd better
leave them alone!

73
00:05:52,821 --> 00:05:55,619
How beautiful! It's like being
in Heaven again!

74
00:05:57,541 --> 00:05:59,896
It's like a garden
of white flowers!

75
00:06:04,261 --> 00:06:06,252
Oh..! I heard a noise!

76
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:45,096
Try to recover, old man!
Come on!

77
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:47,132
Come on, tell me what happened, please!

78
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:51,895
- He has regained consciousness!
- You are a citizen of Silverland!

79
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:55,100
Take me to the castle,
I must warn the King!

80
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:58,212
Union X is coming
with a terrible weapon!

81
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:04,456
Your snowman
is much more beautiful than mine!

82
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,651
No, yours is much better!

83
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,298
Look!

84
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:16,331
Sapphire, in reality I didn't
only come here to play with you.

85
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:19,293
I would like to discover the origin
of this mysterious sound!

86
00:07:20,420 --> 00:07:22,935
Sapphire! Sapphire!

87
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:25,571
Sapphire... Sapphire...

88
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:28,495
Union X has reached

89
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:30,736
...bringing with it
a terrible weapon!

90
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,692
Indeed, it is a horrible weapon!

91
00:07:32,740 --> 00:07:35,812
The border guards
have all been killed!

92
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:38,532
- What?!
- What?!

93
00:07:42,420 --> 00:07:45,731
Sapphire, that sound could
come from Union X's weapon!

94
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:49,337
I'm going to explore the forest
of orange trees, will you come with me?

95
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:51,852
Choppy, show me the way!

96
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,131
Wait for me!
How will you get there without me?

97
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:14,451
Choppy, are you sure
it’s right here?

98
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:16,617
Of course! I’m sure
this is the place.

99
00:08:16,820 --> 00:08:19,733
But it’s completely
deserted! Not a soul in sight!

100
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:23,258
Franco, I have the feeling
that someone is watching us!

101
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:42,618
You know, to tell you the
truth, I have the same feeling too!

102
00:08:45,341 --> 00:08:47,093
Watch out!

103
00:08:48,621 --> 00:08:50,612
Who are you? Come out of there!

104
00:08:53,461 --> 00:08:56,373
We are the patrol squad
of Union X!

105
00:08:56,421 --> 00:08:58,412
You won’t leave here alive!

106
00:09:04,901 --> 00:09:06,812
- Zaffiro!
- Yes, Franco!

107
00:09:09,701 --> 00:09:11,498
Take this!

108
00:09:13,341 --> 00:09:15,332
Good job, Choppy!

109
00:09:22,501 --> 00:09:24,492
We’ll tear you to pieces!

110
00:09:25,461 --> 00:09:27,372
Come on!

111
00:09:27,421 --> 00:09:29,571
Look, we've put them to flight!

112
00:09:30,981 --> 00:09:35,054
Don't claim victory yet! You're in for something very interesting!

113
00:09:36,621 --> 00:09:39,738
Too bad for you! You can't imagine the end that awaits you!

114
00:09:42,141 --> 00:09:45,133
I don't know what we should expect, but I'm not afraid!

115
00:09:48,301 --> 00:09:50,212
This noise...

116
00:09:59,461 --> 00:10:02,294
- Sapphire!
- Here I am, Franco, I'm here!

117
00:10:02,741 --> 00:10:04,618
Hey, is everything okay?

118
00:10:05,301 --> 00:10:08,498
- Yes! Everything's fine!
- Get down!

119
00:10:21,821 --> 00:10:24,130
The eagle of ill omen?!

120
00:10:30,541 --> 00:10:32,452
I want to see for myself!

121
00:10:35,541 --> 00:10:37,736
Wait, Franco, we're coming with you!

122
00:10:58,621 --> 00:11:00,612
Load!

123
00:11:09,021 --> 00:11:10,898
Fire!

124
00:11:17,581 --> 00:11:20,414
Our cannon will reduce Silverland Castle

125
00:11:20,461 --> 00:11:23,214
...to a pile of ruins!
Let's move forward!

126
00:11:49,901 --> 00:11:54,019
Keep going like this!
Set course for Silverland!

127
00:12:06,341 --> 00:12:08,730
So that noise was the roar of the cannon!

128
00:12:08,781 --> 00:12:12,091
A disaster will happen if that big cannon crosses the border!

129
00:12:12,461 --> 00:12:14,531
We must prevent it at all costs!

130
00:12:14,701 --> 00:12:18,011
Right! We will prevent it! That weapon will not enter Silverland!

131
00:12:24,221 --> 00:12:28,009
- Sapphire, do you have any good ideas?
- Yes! Look down there!

132
00:12:28,781 --> 00:12:31,659
We will collapse the bridge over the river that marks the border!

133
00:12:32,101 --> 00:12:35,537
Luckily, they didn't
destroy the guard post.

134
00:12:35,941 --> 00:12:38,011
There must be some
gunpowder there!

135
00:12:38,461 --> 00:12:40,975
That seems like a good
idea! We'll blow up the bridge.

136
00:12:41,021 --> 00:12:44,331
What will we do if those
soldiers try to occupy the Fortress?

137
00:12:45,021 --> 00:12:47,091
We'll do everything to defeat them!

138
00:13:19,261 --> 00:13:21,377
Oh no, it's about to leave!

139
00:13:24,221 --> 00:13:27,099
Choppy, we've beaten
them all, you can come!

140
00:13:33,741 --> 00:13:37,017
Look! Here are the
barrels of gunpowder.

141
00:13:37,261 --> 00:13:40,970
It should be enough. The
problem is how to transport it.

142
00:13:41,021 --> 00:13:43,660
I've got an idea!
We'll build a sled...

143
00:13:43,701 --> 00:13:45,657
...and we will bring
you the gunpowder!

144
00:14:05,461 --> 00:14:07,452
Let's go!

145
00:14:10,581 --> 00:14:12,776
Come on, gallop, little horses!

146
00:14:16,421 --> 00:14:20,300
Good! Like that! Hurray! Cheers!

147
00:14:20,901 --> 00:14:23,415
Hold on, Choppy, or you'll
be thrown to the ground!

148
00:14:31,101 --> 00:14:33,012
Let's catch up to them!

149
00:14:38,621 --> 00:14:40,771
- The Union squad!
- What?!

150
00:14:40,821 --> 00:14:43,335
- Are they already chasing us?
- Come on! Faster!

151
00:14:49,541 --> 00:14:51,896
Watch out, Sapphire!
The soldiers have skis...

152
00:14:51,941 --> 00:14:54,296
...with sharp points!
- Really?!

153
00:14:56,421 --> 00:14:58,332
Good heavens!

154
00:15:00,901 --> 00:15:02,892
Dammit! The sled!

155
00:15:10,741 --> 00:15:13,130
- What's happening, Sapphire?
- They've detached the horses.

156
00:15:13,181 --> 00:15:16,218
- We'll have to steer the sled ourselves!
- What?!

157
00:15:16,301 --> 00:15:18,337
Sapphire and Choppy are in danger!

158
00:15:18,821 --> 00:15:21,494
- Sapphire!
- Franz!

159
00:15:28,701 --> 00:15:30,817
We're going to crash into the bridge!

160
00:15:31,781 --> 00:15:33,692
Help!

161
00:15:43,541 --> 00:15:46,419
- Choppy, is everything okay?
- Yes, everything's okay!

162
00:15:50,261 --> 00:15:52,172
Watch out, Choppy!

163
00:15:55,781 --> 00:15:58,773
Sapphire, I'm afraid these soldiers
are too many for you, you know?

164
00:16:00,541 --> 00:16:02,532
I'm coming, Sapphire!

165
00:16:09,941 --> 00:16:12,694
Franz, all the gunpowder
has fallen into the river!

166
00:16:12,941 --> 00:16:16,650
There's nothing more to be done!
So for now let's go back to the Fortress.

167
00:16:22,901 --> 00:16:25,290
- Dammit! - They hit her!
- Yes, they hit her!

168
00:16:25,341 --> 00:16:28,413
- By now it's been razed to the ground!
- We must hide!

169
00:16:42,421 --> 00:16:44,332
Fire!

170
00:16:52,301 --> 00:16:54,974
There's a gorge further ahead,
we can hide there!

171
00:17:56,901 --> 00:17:59,096
How come my glove
got scorched?

172
00:18:00,101 --> 00:18:04,140
I've got it! That icicle acted
as a lens and burned the glove!

173
00:18:05,901 --> 00:18:07,812
Yeah, a lens!

174
00:18:08,301 --> 00:18:11,418
It's an idea! If we used
the icicles as lenses...

175
00:18:13,021 --> 00:18:17,060
This gorge is not big and one can
easily trigger an avalanche!

176
00:18:17,101 --> 00:18:19,376
That way, perhaps, we can block
that big cannon!

177
00:18:20,341 --> 00:18:23,492
Luckily the sun is still high!
Maybe we'll succeed!

178
00:18:35,821 --> 00:18:38,381
Guys, we have to look
for a piece of ice!

179
00:18:38,421 --> 00:18:41,333
- As big as possible!
- All right!

180
00:18:42,981 --> 00:18:45,495
We must hurry
or we won't make it!

181
00:18:51,261 --> 00:18:54,298
I thought I'd easily find
pieces of ice in so much snow,

182
00:18:54,341 --> 00:18:56,332
but now I don't see
even one!

183
00:18:59,581 --> 00:19:02,812
Who knows what Sapphire wants
to do with the ice!

184
00:19:06,021 --> 00:19:08,012
I'm on the ice.

185
00:19:09,021 --> 00:19:11,012
Help! I'm slipping!
Sapphire!

186
00:19:15,341 --> 00:19:17,013
There it is!

187
00:19:18,021 --> 00:19:21,058
Haven't you finished yet?
The ice is heavy!

188
00:19:21,581 --> 00:19:24,379
Hang in there, Choppy,
try to hold on a little longer!

189
00:19:24,421 --> 00:19:26,571
We're almost finished. There!

190
00:19:40,021 --> 00:19:43,457
There is a danger of avalanches
here; if we make noise, they will bury us!

191
00:19:43,501 --> 00:19:45,412
Put out that fire!

192
00:19:57,341 --> 00:20:00,458
I finally understand!
- You want to blow up the cannon...

193
00:20:00,501 --> 00:20:02,412
...with the ice lens!
- Yes, of course!

194
00:20:02,461 --> 00:20:04,497
Since we have the
sun on our side...

195
00:20:05,581 --> 00:20:07,572
We must try!

196
00:20:08,501 --> 00:20:10,890
Shine on our glories, sun!

197
00:20:11,021 --> 00:20:13,330
Celebrate the invasion of Silverland!

198
00:20:13,541 --> 00:20:16,453
Look at how powerful
we are with our weapons!

199
00:20:16,741 --> 00:20:19,380
Union X will conquer the world!

200
00:20:19,861 --> 00:20:23,410
And you will see our banners
on every continent!

201
00:20:29,981 --> 00:20:32,336
Good heavens! I missed my aim!

202
00:20:33,101 --> 00:20:36,173
Franco, we must immediately
direct the beam onto the fuse!

203
00:20:43,501 --> 00:20:46,732
We are being attacked from above!
Archers, quick!

204
00:20:51,461 --> 00:20:54,612
Be careful, Franco!
Don't expose yourself too much! Take cover!

205
00:20:54,941 --> 00:20:57,216
Yes! But you be careful
of the arrows too!

206
00:20:58,621 --> 00:21:01,089
Damn,
they grazed me!

207
00:21:07,101 --> 00:21:09,217
Shoot! Kill them!

208
00:21:19,261 --> 00:21:21,172
The fuse will catch fire!

209
00:21:56,461 --> 00:21:58,816
The avalanche!
The avalanche!

210
00:22:03,501 --> 00:22:06,459
- Help!
- Let's run!

211
00:22:44,821 --> 00:22:47,733
Sapphire! Choppy!
Hold on tight to the tree!

212
00:23:10,021 --> 00:23:14,299
- Franco, how are you?
- Fine. And you, are you safe and sound?

213
00:23:14,661 --> 00:23:16,652
Of course! Everything is fine!

214
00:23:17,541 --> 00:23:19,532
Let's see what became
of the cannon!

215
00:23:21,661 --> 00:23:23,970
Hurray, we have destroyed
Union X!

216
00:23:24,021 --> 00:23:26,740
The cannon by now
is buried forever under the snow!

217
00:23:49,141 --> 00:23:51,939
Look, the sun is melting
the snow eagle!

218
00:23:51,981 --> 00:23:54,814
But the Union can rise again,
so we must be ready...

219
00:23:54,861 --> 00:23:57,011
...to defend ourselves
at any moment.

220
00:24:13,261 --> 00:24:16,571
You know, Franco, we must maintain
peace at all costs.

221
00:24:21,181 --> 00:24:24,378
And so we will have to be
always united to defend it.

222
00:24:52,900 --> 00:24:56,520
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

223
00:24:56,521 --> 00:24:59,881
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

224
00:24:59,882 --> 00:25:03,652
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

225
00:25:03,653 --> 00:25:06,814
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

226
00:25:06,815 --> 00:25:10,628
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

227
00:25:10,629 --> 00:25:13,925
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

228
00:25:13,926 --> 00:25:17,931
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

229
00:25:17,932 --> 00:25:21,370
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

230
00:25:21,371 --> 00:25:24,991
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

231
00:25:24,992 --> 00:25:28,352
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

232
00:25:28,353 --> 00:25:32,123
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

233
00:25:32,124 --> 00:25:35,285
Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo!
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

234
00:25:35,309 --> 00:25:46,856
